rst:0x1 (POWERON),boot:0x6c (SPI_FAST_FLASH_BOOT)
SPIWP:0xee
mode:DIO, clock div:2
load:0x40800000,len:0x2c4e0
load:0x4083c000,len:0x1b3a0
entry 0x40800000

  ==============================================
   KickOS 0.5.1  -  microkernel RTOS
  ==============================================
   board   esp32c6-wroom
   arch    rv32imac
   cpu     esp32c6
# c6amp: LP RTC 136000 Hz
# ampdiag: peer node=1 vectors=0x4083c001 tag=0 clk=20000000 self clk=160000000
ampping: 2 of 2 node app(s) alive on the port the partition names, own row 1
ampping: gate: node 0 read 0x5a3c from its timg0, node 1 read 0x1f07 from its timg1 and 0x0 from node 0's timg0
ampping: node 0 calls node 1 port 3
  ping 1 -> pong 2 from node 1 (4 byte(s))
  (node 1 answered on attempt 2)
  ping 2 -> pong 3 from node 1 (4 byte(s))
  ping 3 -> pong 4 from node 1 (4 byte(s))
  ping 4 -> pong 5 from node 1 (4 byte(s))
ampping: node 1 answered 4 round(s), its own record says 4
ampping: node 0 done, 4 round(s) across the partition
ampping: the doorbell has no seat, so no raise of it can be deferred (rc -38)
# ampdiag: node=0 core=0 bells=9 drains=9
# ampdiag: node=1 core=1 bells=6 drains=6
